{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文推介周大福(1929)，指公司上財年多賺逾52%，業績理想，加上大股東近期持續增持股份，有利股價反彈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026A5obtErSx81790744840.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議現價可買入，目標上望8月高位、約13元，止蝕價放在9.5元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">周大福(1929)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$13</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$9.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026lMpkjXwRcx1790744859.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦看好TCL電子(1070)，公司3月與Sony合資經營家庭娛樂業務，有望帶動TCL電子擴大電視產品市場份額，而公司亦增加高端產品佔比，有助毛利率擴闊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ssanPnLDdn1790744874.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股價周三曾破頂，他認為現價仍可追入，目標價22元，止蝕15元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TCL電子(1070)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$22</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$15</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026P80HpNaS3G1790744892.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T05:59:53.230861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}